// My smoking habit stages
"smoking_habit_stage_thinking_title" = "Thinking about quitting";
"smoking_habit_stage_thinking_body" = "You are considering it but haven't made a decision yet.\n\nThat's perfectly ok! We will guide you through the benefits of quitting smoking, and then you can decide if you'd like to create a plan for quitting.\nMove to Make a plan.";
"smoking_habit_stage_ready_title" = "Getting ready to quit";
"smoking_habit_stage_ready_body" = "You've decided to quit smoking.\n\nGreat decision! We will guide you on how to create a solid plan and help you stay focused on your journey.\nMove to Make a plan.";
"smoking_habit_stage_quitting_title" = "Quitting";
"smoking_habit_stage_quitting_body" = "You've already started or set a date to quit smoking.\n\nThat's great! We will help you create a strategic plan and stay focused on your goal.\nMove to Make a plan.";
"smoking_habit_stage_smokefree_title" = "Staying smoke-free";
"smoking_habit_stage_smokefree_body" = "You're focusing on avoiding relapse and keeping up your progress.\n\nThat's fantastic. It's important not to let your guard down. We will be here to support you to stay strong.\nMove to Make a plan to register the day you started quitting smoking, then you can use Stay focused.";

// Challenging to quit journey (Swift UI)
"challenging_to_quit_header" = "Why is it challenging to quit?";
"challenging_to_quit_body_paragraph_1" = "Most teens who smoke think they will quit in their 20s and actually don't until their 40s. Stopping smoking is about making a change and that is something we're not too good at, in fact smoking cessation can be a long journey of trying and relapsing, just like a long ride on a roller coaster. There is no magic solution or medication to transform one to a non-smoker overnight, though some people have the gene to be able to quit smoking or drinking without any struggles.";
"challenging_to_quit_body_paragraph_2" = "So what does this ride of change look like? There are 4 steps and helpful strategies you can take!";
"challenging_to_quit_topic_thinking" = "\"I'm thinking about quitting\"";
"challenging_to_quit_topic_ready" = "\"Getting ready to quit\"";
"challenging_to_quit_topic_quitting" = "\"Quitting\"";
"challenging_to_quit_topic_smoke_free" = "\"Staying smoke-free\"";
"thinking_about_quitting_header" = "\"I'm thinking about quitting\"";
"thinking_about_quitting_body_paragraph_1" = "Approximately 75% of smokers want to quit, but 25% are not interested. Perhaps you are thinking about it, but not quite ready to act. Although, cigarettes are expensive, you might still like the sensations of smoking. You may also feel pressured to quit because people smoke on the break or you live with someone who also smokes.";
"thinking_about_quitting_body_paragraph_2" = "But just so you know, thinking about quitting is already a first big step forward toward change! It's normal to feel intimidated by taking action. No one wants to fail.. But think about this.. If it's going to be a challenge now and it's going to be a challenge in 5 years, why not do it now without spending more money on cigarettes?";
"ready_to_quit_header" = "\"I'm ready to quit\"";
"ready_to_quit_body_paragraph_1" = "If you have even tried to quit once in the past, you have some idea how it feels, the challenges you experienced, and what caused you to start smoking again. That means you've already tasted this journey and know how tricky it can be. There are small steps you can take now to help you quit for good and increase your chances of success. Learn the skills that will help you permanently achieve a tobacco-free life.";
"ready_to_quit_body_paragraph_2" = "In the following sections, you can learn about recommended strategies for overcoming potential challenges you may encounter!";
"trying_to_quit_header" = "\"I'm trying to quit\"";
"trying_to_quit_body_paragraph_1" = "You've reached your quit date and committed yourself to a tobacco-free life.";
"trying_to_quit_body_paragraph_2" = "Be proud! Quit smoking is like a relationship breakup and going through some losses.. You might have to break up your routine a little bit to avoid certain places, friends, and start a new routine to distract yourself. The plan requires you to think about more than just quitting smoking, but changes to your lifestyle.";
"trying_to_quit_body_paragraph_3" = "There are some keys to achieve a permanent tobacco-free life.";
"trying_to_quit_body_paragraph_4" = "What can you do?";
"trying_to_quit_habits_heading" = "What new habits are helping you keep going?";
"trying_to_quit_habit_bullet_1" = "Do something to stay active at home";
"trying_to_quit_habit_bullet_2" = "Call or visit a friend or family member";
"trying_to_quit_habit_bullet_3" = "Brush your teeth";
"trying_to_quit_habit_bullet_4" = "Play with a pet";
"trying_to_quit_habit_bullet_5" = "Update your contact list on your cell phone";
"trying_to_quit_habit_bullet_6" = "Try a new hobby";
"trying_to_quit_habit_bullet_7" = "Switch to coffee with less caffeine or decaf products";
"trying_to_quit_rewards_heading" = "How much money have you saved by quitting tobacco? How are you rewarding yourself?";
"trying_to_quit_celebrate_heading" = "Celebrate being tobacco-free for:";
"trying_to_quit_milestone_3_days" = "3 days";
"trying_to_quit_milestone_7_days" = "7 days";
"trying_to_quit_milestone_2_weeks" = "2 weeks";
"trying_to_quit_milestone_1_month" = "1 month";
"trying_to_quit_milestone_3_months" = "3 months";
"trying_to_quit_milestone_6_months" = "6 months";
"trying_to_quit_milestone_1_year" = "1 year";
"tobacco_free_header" = "\"I'm tobacco free\"";
"tobacco_free_body_paragraph_1" = "Now you are a non-smoker and are trying to stay that way. When we make changes, it's critical to meditate on how important this change is to you and how confident you are in making this change. You want to pay attention to how your mind, body, and emotional regulation feel differently, how your attitude changed, and what you have started doing instead for better self-care.";
"tobacco_free_body_paragraph_2" = "Thinking about it helps you to not go back to your old relationship with smoking.";
"tobacco_free_body_paragraph_3" = "Now you know what to expect on this ride. It won't hit you as a surprise when you expect ups and downs of this journey! Remember it's all about coming up with a strategy that works for you, it's not about your will power.";
"tobacco_free_body_paragraph_4" = "Are you out of the woods? Many people want to know how long it takes before the chance of going back to tobacco is no longer a concern. Relapse most commonly happens in the first one to three months after quitting.";
"tobacco_free_body_paragraph_5" = "However, it's always wise to be on guard";

